BU_: PCS PCS_Controller VCU HVCU MCU i3LIM GearLever T2C GFM Drive_Unit Superman PEDAL CRUISE EPB VEHICLE XXX


CM_ "BMW E90 EV can2_powertrain. Cleaned from BMW_can2_powertrain.dbc. Pedal firmware (pedal_arduino.ino) is law for 0x199/0x200/0x201. Live brake is VCU SendAbsDscMessages 0x0A8 (BO_ 168); e9x EngineAndBrake 0x168 is ICE DME and must not be used for OP brake.";

